<h2>Booking</h2>
<details><summary>Do I need an account?</summary><p>No. You book with your name, e-mail and phone number. You then receive a personal link to track, discuss or cancel your booking.</p></details>
<details><summary>Are the displayed slots really available?</summary><p>Yes. They are computed in real time from the venue’s cabins, pools and therapists, its opening hours and closures. A displayed slot may still be taken by another client a few seconds before you: if so, we tell you immediately.</p></details>
<details><summary>Is my booking confirmed right away?</summary><p>Your request is sent to the venue, which usually confirms quickly. You receive an e-mail at each step. Without an answer within the indicated time, the request expires automatically and nothing is owed.</p></details>
<details><summary>Can I book for several people?</summary><p>Yes: choose the number of participants and, if you wish, a different treatment for each. “For 2” packages and group prices are shown where available.</p></details>
<details><summary>What are “extras”?</summary><p>Options offered by the venue (additional scrub, mask, tea and pastries…) added to your ritual when booking. Their price and duration are shown before confirmation.</p></details>

<h2>Prices and payment</h2>
<details><summary>How do I pay?</summary><p>Unless stated otherwise on the listing, you pay directly at the venue on the day of your appointment, at the price shown in your confirmation. No online payment or deposit is currently requested on the platform.</p></details>
<details><summary>Can the price change after confirmation?</summary><p>No. The price locked in your confirmation is the one to pay (excluding any extras you add on site).</p></details>

<h2>Cancellation and changes</h2>
<details><summary>How do I cancel?</summary><p>From your tracking link, “Cancel my booking”. Cancellation is free up to the deadline shown on the venue’s listing.</p></details>
<details><summary>How do I change the date or time?</summary><p>Message the venue from your tracking page, or cancel and book a new slot if the deadline allows.</p></details>
<details><summary>Can the venue cancel my booking?</summary><p>Not on its own. It must submit a justified request; you are informed and may respond, then HammamLuxury decides. No fee is charged to you in that case.</p></details>

<h2>At the venue</h2>
<details><summary>When do I get the exact address?</summary><p>The neighbourhood is shown on the listing; the full address and the venue’s phone number are in your confirmation e-mail and on your tracking page.</p></details>
<details><summary>What should I bring?</summary><p>See the “Practical info” section of the listing: mixed or separate areas, attire, children, pregnancy, accessibility, spoken languages. If in doubt, message the venue.</p></details>
<details><summary>I am late or cannot come.</summary><p>Let the venue know via messaging or by phone. A no-show without cancellation may be recorded as such.</p></details>

<h2>Reviews and trust</h2>
<details><summary>Who can leave a review?</summary><p>Only clients whose treatment actually took place, upon an invitation received the next day. Reviews are checked before publication and marked as verified.</p></details>
<details><summary>How are venues selected?</summary><p>Each partner provides its legal information, permits and at least ten photos; its listing is checked by our team before publication.</p></details>

<h2>Partners</h2>
<details><summary>I run a hammam or spa: how do I join HammamLuxury?</summary><p>Go to <a href="{{ route('filament.partner.auth.register') }}">List my venue</a>. Describe your venue, treatments, resources and opening hours; once approved, you manage bookings from a simple, free dashboard. HammamLuxury earns a commission on completed bookings.</p></details>

<p style="margin-top:20px">Didn’t find your answer? <a href="{{ route('contact') }}">Contact us</a>.</p>
